        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-ATL05F012, Contemporary Bling Glass Door Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe of 12Inch Contemporary Bling Glass Door Pull Set are filled with filled with faux diamond shaped crystals and fitted with the contemporary end brackets. Sold as a pair (2 pulls) with all the hardware needed to mount them back-to-back on a glass shower door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back-to-Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a glass door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions 12 Inch Atlantic Series 5F Crystal Shower Pull Pair: \r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear Acrylic filled with Glass Crystals</li>\r\n<li>Filigree Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATL05F012-specifications.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>First Impressions ATL05F012 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These decorative door pulls are handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 3 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors.</b>\r\n</p>",
